{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月24日，據《商業內幕》報道，在黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)回歸英偉達後，投資者再度大舉買入該公司股票。此前，黃仁勳被免職的消息曾導致英偉達股價跌至數年來的低點。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587776.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:23:52.382445+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:58:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_hash":"a24151340194935cd64e81d6aeb9d93da8c070a11eb75a839b2372b88ea30263","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}